# Data loading facade.
#
# Public import: importa ex "gradus:data" privata data
# Depends on: gradus:tensor
#
# Will split into nested leaves when ≥2 data concerns are implemented:
#   gradus:data/batch     batching and shuffling
#   gradus:data/token     tokenization (char-level, BPE)
#
# Architectural rule: data loading is separate from training. The Shakespeare
# corpus and a future safetensors dataset feed the same training loop through
# the same batch interface.
